9d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 2, "prompt": "You hear a consultant giving a talk to a group of trainees.\nWhat is the purpose of the talk?\nSelect one:\nA. to highlight the symptoms associated with a head injury.\nB. to discuss the importance of waking patients after a head injury.\nC. to convey the significance of the initial 24 hours after a head injury.", "sourcePage": 211, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 216, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 3, "prompt": "You head a vet talking to a client who brought this pet cat,\nJimmy, to the vet clinic.\nWhat does the vet say has caused Jimmy's problem urinating?\nSelect one:\nA. Stress from renovations.\nB. A fatal urethral obstruction.\nC. Struvite cyrstals in his urethra", "sourcePage": 211, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 216, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 4, "prompt": "You hear the nurse unit manager (NUM) discussing the\nprogress if a patient at a multi-disciplinary team meeting.\nWhat does she indicate about the patient's son?\nSelect one:\nA. That he hasn't been feeding the patient.\nB. That the patient is largely dependent on him.\nC. That he is having problems in his role as a carer.", "sourcePage": 212, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 216, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 5, "prompt": "You hear a radiographer talking to nursing staff at an aged\ncare centre.\nThe radiographer is\nSelect one:\nA. helping nurses prepare patients for CT scans.\nB. stressing the importance of contrast media in CT scans.\nC. highlighting problems that occur when conducting CT scans.", "sourcePage": 212, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 216, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 6, "prompt": "You hear a GP discussing psoriasis with a patient.\nThe GP recommends sunbed treatment because\nSelect one:\nA. UVB light is unique in a hospital setting.\nB. there is currently a shortage of cream.\nC. it will help with the effects of the rash.", "sourcePage": 212, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 216, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}], "skills": ["listening"], "recordings": ["55e5ec9202e36c5a8defe0b63d9d58f8f46a1ccc1a6f067c49de6eddf649bf67"], "answerSources": [], "matchEvidence": "Exact original recording SHA-256 in the verified Jahshan collection"}]}
